 </span><span begin="00:19.200" end="00:19.890">started </span><span begin="00:19.890" end="00:20.100">at </span><span begin="00:20.100" end="00:20.310">the </span><span begin="00:20.310" end="00:21.090">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.120" end="00:25.380"><span begin="00:21.120" end="00:21.900">Say </span><span begin="00:21.900" end="00:22.800">yeah</span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:23.100">, </span><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.580">let's </span><span begin="00:23.580" end="00:23.820">be </span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:24.300">alone </span><span begin="00:24.300" end="00:25.380">together</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.770" end="00:28.380"><span begin="00:25.770" end="00:26.040">We </span><span begin="00:26.040" end="00:26.250">could </span><span begin="00:26.250" end="00:26.580">stay </span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.910">young </span><span begin="00:26.910" end="00:28.380">forever</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.440" end="00:31.890"><span begin="00:28.440" end="00:28.830">Scream </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:28.950">it </span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:29.130">from </span><span begin="00:29.130" end="00:29.250">the </span><span begin="00:29.250" end="00:29.520">top </span><span begin="00:29.520" end="00:29.580">of </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.760">your </span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:31.890">lungs</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.890" end="00:36.360"><span begin="00:31.890" end="00:32.550">Say </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:33.690">yeah</span><span begin="00:33.690" end="00:33.750">, </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.260">let's </span><span begin="00:34.260" end="00:34.500">be </span><span begin="00:34.500" end="00:34.950">alone </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:36.360">together</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.630" end="00:39.450"><span begin="00:36.630" end="00:36.750">We </span><span begin="00:36.750" end="00:36.900">could </span><span